          "_name": "article12",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article12\" group=\"Article\">    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#eae7dc\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>Disclaimer:Praveen Singh Founder praveen World</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">The storytelling magic of photos\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">The content provided through this Stock Market &amp; Mutual Fund Training Program by Praveen Singh Founder Praveen World Wealth is for educational and informational purposes only. It is not intended as investment, financial, legal, or tax advice, nor should it be interpreted as a recommendation to buy, sell, or hold any financial instruments.<br><br>Praveen Singh Founder Praveen World  Wealth operates as:<br><br><br>* An Authorized Person/Sub-Broker under a SEBI-registered stockbroker, and<br>* An AMFI-registered Mutual Fund Distributor under SEBI.<br><br>We are not SEBI-registered Investment Advisors, and we do not offer personalized financial advice, guaranteed return schemes, or portfolio management services.<br><br> ⚠️ Risk Disclosures:<br><br>* Stock Market investments and trading involve risk. Past performance is not indicative of future results. Prices of securities may fluctuate, and there is no assurance of profit.<br><br>* Leverage, Options, and Derivatives trading are high-risk strategies and should be undertaken with caution and proper risk management.<br><br>* Mutual Fund investments are subject to market risks. Please read all scheme-related documents carefully before investing.<br><br>All strategies, case studies, and examples shared in this course are based on personal research, market experience, and general knowledge. You are responsible for your own trading and investment decisions. We do not accept liability for any financial loss arising from the use of information provided.<br><br>We recommend consulting with a licensed professional or SEBI-registered Investment Advisor for personalized financial advice.<br><br>We wish you a successful trading and investing journey, but remember—success depends on your own knowledge, continuous learning, research, discipline, and risk management.<br><br>Warm regards,<br>Praveen Singh<br>Founder – Praveen World<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
